    "body": "Is there a way to grep_live on my current buffer?",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Is there a way to grep_live on my current buffer?</p>",
    "bodyText": "Is there a way to grep_live on my current buffer?",
    "category": {
