            },
            "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "I'm trying:\r\n\r\n```\r\n    vim.keymap.set('n', '<leader>/', function()\r\n      require(mini.pick).builtin.grep_live {\r\n        globs = {\r\n          vim.fn.expand '%F%m%r',\r\n        },\r\n      }\r\n    end)\r\n```\r\n\r\nbut it doesn't work for help files for example :(",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I'm trying:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"    vim.keymap.set('n', '&lt;leader&gt;/', function()\n      require(mini.pick).builtin.grep_live {\n        globs = {\n          vim.fn.expand '%F%m%r',\n        },\n      }\n    end)\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">    vim.keymap.set('n', '&lt;leader&gt;/', function()\n      require(mini.pick).builtin.grep_live {\n        globs = {\n          vim.fn.expand '%F%m%r',\n        },\n      }\n    end)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">but it doesn't work for help files for example :(</p>",
            "bodyText": "I'm trying:\n    vim.keymap.set('n', '<leader>/', function()\n      require(mini.pick).builtin.grep_live {\n        globs = {\n          vim.fn.expand '%F%m%r',\n        },\n      }\n    end)\n\nbut it doesn't work for help files for example :(",
